Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:26:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): warn when a PR review marker is stale

Read collaborator markers from comments and reviews before planning merges.
Keep warnings on stderr so JSON output stays usable.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2388
